        "original_id": "32a0ee43-1a0e-5cae-a789-5d937241f019",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jodie Foster, Alan Di Fiore, Jim Kouf, Jamie Linden, Giancarlo Esposito, Gustavo Fring\n- Works: Money Monster, Breaking Bad, Better Call Saul\n- Awards: Critics' Choice Television Awards, Primetime Emmy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Giancarlo Giuseppe Alessandro Esposito was born on April 26, 1958, and is an American actor.\n- Money Monster is a 2016 American thriller film directed by Jodie Foster and written by Alan Di Fiore, Jim Kouf, and Jamie Linden.\n- Giancarlo Esposito is best known for portraying Gustavo \"Gus\" Fring on the AMC shows Breaking Bad and Better Call Saul.\n- Giancarlo Esposito won the Best Supporting Actor in a Drama award at the 2012 Critics' Choice Television Awards for his role as Gustavo Fring.\n- Giancarlo Esposito was nominated for the Outstanding Supporting Actor in a Drama Series award at the 2012 Primetime Emmy Awards for his role as Gustavo Fring.",
